  "statSections": [
    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Multiattack. The mage makes three Arcane Burst attacks.\n\nArcane Burst. Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. or range 120 ft. Hit: 16 (3d8 + 3) Force damage.\n\nSpellcasting. The mage casts one of the following spells, using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 14):\n\nAt Will: Detect Magic, Light, Mage Armor (included in AC), Mage Hand, Prestidigitation\n\n2/Day Each: Fireball (level 4 version), Invisibility\n\n1/Day Each: Cone of Cold, Fly",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.154",
        "heading": "Actions",
        "lineStart": 22681,
        "lineEnd": 22693
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Bonus Actions",
      "rulesText": "Misty Step (3/Day). The mage casts Misty Step, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.154",
        "heading": "Bonus Actions",
        "lineStart": 22695,
        "lineEnd": 22697
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Reactions",
      "rulesText": "Protective Magic (3/Day). The mage casts Counterspell or Shield in response to the spell's trigger, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.154",
        "heading": "Reactions",
        "lineStart": 22699,
        "lineEnd": 22701
      }
    }
  ],
  "rulesText": "Medium or Small Humanoid (Wizard), Neutral\n\nAC 15\nInitiative +2 (12)\nHP 81 (18d8)\nSpeed 30 ft.\n\nSkills Arcana +6, History +6, Perception +4\nGear Wand\nSenses Passive Perception 14\nLanguages Common plus three other languages\nCR 6 (XP 2,300; PB +3)\n\nActions\n\nMultiattack. The mage makes three Arcane Burst attacks.\n\nArcane Burst. Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. or range 120 ft. Hit: 16 (3d8 + 3) Force damage.\n\nSpellcasting. The mage casts one of the following spells, using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 14):\n\nAt Will: Detect Magic, Light, Mage Armor (included in AC), Mage Hand, Prestidigitation\n\n2/Day Each: Fireball (level 4 version), Invisibility\n\n1/Day Each: Cone of Cold, Fly\n\nBonus Actions\n\nMisty Step (3/Day). The mage casts Misty Step, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.\n\nReactions\n\nProtective Magic (3/Day). The mage casts Counterspell or Shield in response to the spell's trigger, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.",
